<title>USA: Adolph Coors Co Q4 net lower.</title>
<headline>Adolph Coors Co Q4 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			13 weeks    14 weeks    53 weeks    53 weeks</p>
<p>			  Ended	 Ended	 Ended	Ended</p>
<p>			 Dec. 29     Dec. 3l     Dec. 29    Dec. 31</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	  1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales	   404,122     415,565   1,732,233  1,679,586</p>
<p> Net income	    3,961	 6,159	43,425     43,178</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>			    0.10	  0.16	  1.14	 1.13</p>
<p>Special charge (credit)</p>
<p>			   7,853	(15,200)	6,341   (15,200)</p>
<p> Operating income    6,278	12,246	 81,019     80,378</p>
<p>Operating income per</p>
<p>    share		 0.23	 (0.08)	 1.24	 0.89</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		    37,921,000  37,925,000  37,990,676 38,170,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 net income per share included a $7.9 million pre-tax charge attributable to legal expenses from the 1993 sale of Molson Breweries.</p>
<p>Full-year net income per share includes a $5.2 million pretax charge in the second quarter related to the Molson peoceedings, as well as a $6.7 million pre-tax credit in the third quarter related to underpaid past royalities and interest from Molson.</p>
</text>
